(Cooling system failure,Low coolant levels / Radiator blockage,Refill coolant; clear blockage) '
(Belt slippage,Tension loss / Worn-out belt,Adjust/replace belt) '
(Generator failure,Fuel contamination / Battery failure,Drain fuel; replace battery) '
(Valve leakage,Worn seal / Improper seating,Replace seal; realign valve) '
(Steam trap failure,Clogged drain / Worn internal parts,Clean drain; replace internal components) '
(Bearing failure,Excessive load / Insufficient lubrication,Reduce load; lubricate bearings) '
(Pneumatic system malfunction,Air leaks / Faulty solenoid valve,Detect and fix leaks; replace valve) '
(Structural fatigue,Vibration stress / Corrosion,Reinforce structure; apply anti-corrosion coating) '
(Sensor malfunction,Calibration drift / Wiring issues,Recalibrate sensor; inspect wiring) '
(Clutch failure,Friction plate wear / Misalignment,Replace friction plate; realign clutch) '
(Elevator malfunction,Brake failure / Cable wear,Inspect brakes; replace worn cables) '
() '
(6. Documentation and Reporting) '
() '
(   1. Ensure all maintenance actions are recorded in the asset tracking or maintenance) '
(      log.) '
() '
(   2. If a recurring issue is identified, recommend a preventive maintenance schedule.) '
() '
(   3. Communicate completed work and any outstanding issues to relevant personnel.) '
() '
() '
() '
(Revision History) '
() '
(Version Date         Author              Changes) '
() '
(1.0     2025-03-18 Maintenance Team Initial Draft) '
ET

endstream
